# Step 1: Origin & Species
ashfall-lifepath-step1-kassik-title = Arid Lowlands of Kassik
ashfall-lifepath-step1-kassik-desc = In the scorching dry air of the sandy lowlands of Kassik. The scent of burnt silica, the unyielding honor code of ancestral clans, and scales tempered under the relentless zenith.

ashfall-lifepath-step1-kirwani-title = Bio-chambers of Clan Kirwani
ashfall-lifepath-step1-kirwani-desc = In the sterile condensation of Clan Kirwani's bio-incubator. The steady hum of ventilation turbines, cold light, and the rustle of thousands of wings behind thin alloy partitions.

ashfall-lifepath-step1-damascus-title = Lower Decks of "New Damascus"
ashfall-lifepath-step1-damascus-desc = In the damp iron corridors of the lower decks of "New Damascus" spire. Machine condensation, market spices from crowded corridors, and the rhythmic groan of deep deck hydraulics.

# Step 2: Vector
ashfall-lifepath-step2-engi-title = A patient artisan
ashfall-lifepath-step2-engi-desc = Drawn to lathes, cable routing, and the smell of motor lubricant. Metal is simpler and more reliable than people — it never lies when torqued to specification.

ashfall-lifepath-step2-med-title = A cold head in someone else's panic
ashfall-lifepath-step2-med-desc = Gazing steadily at lacerations and knowing how to clamp an artery. Other people's pain does not paralyze me — it merely dictates the next procedure.

ashfall-lifepath-step2-sec-title = A watchhound knowing its station
ashfall-lifepath-step2-sec-desc = Accustomed to obeying orders and holding the formation. The law is harsh, and the vacuum outside is harsher still. Order only endures through discipline and an iron grip.

ashfall-lifepath-step2-serv-title = Working hands without unnecessary questions
ashfall-lifepath-step2-serv-desc = Took on any foul task without complaint. The station survives not on corporate briefings, but on those who sweep up behind them and brew the bitter coffee.

# Step 3: Inner Crack
ashfall-lifepath-step3-pedant-title = Freezing over the regulation
ashfall-lifepath-step3-pedant-desc = Until the procedure matches in my head, I cannot make a move, even if the bulkhead is already ablaze.
ashfall-lifepath-step3-pedant-weakness = Hesitation when protocols and rules are violated.

ashfall-lifepath-step3-daredevil-title = Snapping at the hesitant
ashfall-lifepath-step3-daredevil-desc = When panic strikes, other people's confusion triggers a cold rage in me — I shove them aside and act recklessly.
ashfall-lifepath-step3-daredevil-weakness = Aggressive flare-ups and reckless disregard for others' safety.

ashfall-lifepath-step3-paranoid-title = Expecting a knife in the back
ashfall-lifepath-step3-paranoid-desc = In a crisis, I watch my colleagues' hands closer than I watch the pressure sensors.
ashfall-lifepath-step3-paranoid-weakness = Distrust of colleagues and delay of rescue measures.

ashfall-lifepath-step3-burnout-title = Complete emotional shutdown
ashfall-lifepath-step3-burnout-desc = The body continues on muscle memory, but inside there is only hollow indifference whether anyone makes it out alive.
ashfall-lifepath-step3-burnout-weakness = Severe apathy and loss of initiative under protracted crisis.

# Step 4: Personal Luggage
ashfall-lifepath-step4-dogtag-title = A stranger's work dogtag
ashfall-lifepath-step4-dogtag-desc = A worn brass tag with a scratched serial number. A keepsake of someone left behind on a decommissioned rig who never reached the shuttle.
ashfall-lifepath-step4-dogtag-quirk = Constantly fingers the cold metal tag around the neck.

ashfall-lifepath-step4-chip-title = An encrypted titanium data-chip
ashfall-lifepath-step4-chip-desc = A high-security memory wafer in a sealed casing. You either forgot the passphrase or fear what lies inside once deciphered.
ashfall-lifepath-step4-chip-quirk = Wears thick insulated work gloves concealing subtle finger tremors.

ashfall-lifepath-step4-key-title = An old brass locker key
ashfall-lifepath-step4-key-desc = A heavy brass key to someone else's locker on a distant orbital drydock. That facility may have been scrapped years ago.
ashfall-lifepath-step4-key-quirk = Hides glances beneath an old cap or patched visor.

ashfall-lifepath-step4-cigs-title = A crushed pack of bitter cigarettes
ashfall-lifepath-step4-cigs-desc = A crumpled pack of cheap orbital tobacco and an old flint lighter bearing the stamp of a long-shuttered berth.
ashfall-lifepath-step4-cigs-quirk = Lights a smoke at the first lull between station alerts.

